    "briefing": "ECKHART SECURITY, LLC.\nCONTRACTS & DISPATCH\n\nCONTRACT TYPE: Recover Cargo\nApproval code: = [ApprovalCode]\n\nFOR IMMEDIATE PROCESSING\n\nClient's cargo was mid-transport when they ran into some ship trouble, and now a group of opportunistic outlaws are looking to cash in on this.\n\nIf you accept, head to [Location] and deal with the outlaws guarding the cargo. Extract it using a heavy-duty tractor beam, recover the cargo, load it in to a ship that can transport [MissionMaxSCUSize] cargo containers, and deposit it on the freight elevator at [Destination].\n\nThis contract is non-negotiable.\n\nThis message may contain confidential, proprietary, privileged and/or private information. The information is intended to be for the use of the individual or entity designated above.",
